"type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"72819479-d7c8-4e92-b62b-e58e9c8b4421","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"81335419-9d87-4a01-a1ea-de6348f19b38","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"829d5943-a4eb-47e3-9dce-ef2d6c519e12","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"8af7e88b-2586-4a89-a6ab-16028c821b1a","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"8edc81f2-bb70-4100-9df7-2552a14e5d75","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"9906dfa8-52c9-40ac-8eef-1099a85c8611","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"a3f81ae7-31b1-4319-9d4c-47d387c8b23e","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"b256dd98-1e69-4348-af24-8df8ddad6db2","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"b5097dd6-a42f-4dba-b281-0609378e939f","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"d1e038c4-d931-4525-9b1b-b943e2a7d7e1","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"e5afc3bc-c054-4b71-a182-a7e5ae9a4417","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"ee794d7d-322e-450f-bff3-1f52ded9a039","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"f90624a8-7964-44da-bd33-78a4c748ef6e","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"}]},{"id":"28c77530-dfa1-4b05-8ec3-998960ba24d4","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Otome Game Sekai wa Mob ni Kibishii Sekai desu"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u4e59\u5973\u30b2\u30fc\u4e16\u754c\u306f\u30e2\u30d6\u306b\u53b3\u3057\u3044\u4e16\u754c\u3067\u3059"},{"ja-ro":"Otomege Sekai wa Mob ni Kibishii Sekai desu"},{"en":"Trapped in a Dating Sim: The World of Otome Games Is Tough for Mobs"},{"ko":"\uc5ec\uc131\ud5a5 \uac8c\uc784 \uc138\uacc4\ub294 \uc5d1\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub77c\uc5d0\uac8c \uc5b4\ub824\uc6b4 \uc138\uc0c1\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4"},{"zh-hk":"\u5973\u6027\u5411\u904a\u6232\u4e16\u754c\u5c0d\u8def\u4eba\u89d2\u8272\u5f88\u4e0d\u53cb\u597d"},{"fr":"Mon Destin... Entre Les Mains Des Femmes"},{"ru":"\u041c\u0438\u0440 \u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u044d-\u0438\u0433\u0440 \u2014 \u044d\u0442\u043e \u0442\u044f\u0436\u0451\u043b\u044b\u0439 \u043c\u0438\u0440 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043c\u043e\u0431\u043e\u0432"},{"th":"\u0e0a\u0e35\u0e27\u0e34\u0e15\u0e15\u0e31\u0e27\u0e1b\u0e23\u0e30\u0e01\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07\u0e15\u0e39\u0e0a\u0e48\u0e32\u0e07\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e39\u0e48\u0e22\u0e32\u0e01\u0e40\u0e21\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e2d\u0e22\u0e39\u0e48\u0e43\u0e19\u0e42\u0e25\u0e01\u0e40\u0e01\u0e21\u0e08\u0e35\u0e1a\u0e2b\u0e19\u0e38\u0e48\u0e21"},{"vi":"Th\u1ebf Gi\u1edbi Otomegame Th\u1eadt Kh\u1eafc Nghi\u1ec7t V\u1edbi Nh\u00e2n V\u1eadt Qu\u1ea7n Ch\u00fang"}],"description":{"en":"Leon, a former Japanese worker, was reincarnated into an \"otome game\" world, and despaired at how it was a world where females hold dominance over males. It was as if men were just livestock that served as stepping stones for females in this world. The only exceptions were the game's romantic targets, a group of handsome men led by the crown prince. In these bizarre circumstances, Leon held one weapon: his knowledge from his previous world, where his brazen sister had forced him to complete this game.","ja":"\u4e59\u5973\u30b2\u30fc\u4e16\u754c\u306b\u8ee2\u751f\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3063\u305f\u30ea\u30aa\u30f3\u3002\u7537\u306f\u5973\u3092\u990a\u3046\u3060\u3051\u306e\u5bb6\u755c\u306e\u69d8\u306a\u5883\u9047\u306b\u3001\u904e\u53bb\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u653b\u7565\u77e5\u8b58\u3092\u4f7f\u3044\u3001\u56f3\u3089\u305a\u3082\u53cd\u65d7\u3092\u7ffb\u3059\u3002\u3000\u30a4\u30b1\u30e1\u30f3\u6b7b\u3059\u3079\u3057\uff01","pt-br":"Leon, um ex-trabalhador japon\u00eas, reencarnou em um mundo de \u201cotome game\u201d e se desesperou com a forma como era um mundo onde as mulheres det\u00eam o dom\u00ednio sobre os homens. Era como se os homens fossem apenas animais que serviram como degraus para as f\u00eameas neste mundo. As \u00fanicas exce\u00e7\u00f5es eram os alvos rom\u00e2nticos do jogo, um grupo de homens bonitos liderados pelo pr\u00edncipe herdeiro. Nestas circunst\u00e2ncias bizarras, Leon tem apenas uma arma: seu conhecimento do seu mundo anterior, que ele obteve ap\u00f3s completar o jogo, depois de ser for\u00e7ado por sua irm\u00e3 a jog\u00e1-lo. Leon, que realmente s\u00f3 quer viver tranquilamente na periferia do pa\u00eds, usa seu conhecimento para bater de frente contra as mulheres e esses homens bonitos."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"104503","ap":"trapped-in-a-dating-sim-the-world-of-otome-games-is-tough-for-mobs","bw":"series\/207004","kt":"54705","mu":"xedkwn7","nu":"the-world-of-otome-games-is-tough-for-mobs","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B07XTR9SVH","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/545088\/","mal":"116157","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/detail\/KC_000053_S","engtl":"https:\/\/sevenseasentertainment.com\/series\/trapped-in-a-dating-sim-the-world-of-otome-games-is-tough-for-mobs-manga\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"13","lastChapter":"68","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":2018,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"0bc90acb-ccc1-44ca-a34a-b9f3a73259d0","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reincarnation"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"256c8bd9-4904-4360-bf4f-508a76d67183","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sci-Fi"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"50880a9d-5440-4732-9afb-8f457127e836","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Mecha"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a39