doujinshi"}]},{"id":"a96676e5-8ae2-425e-b549-7f15dd34a6d8","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Komi-san wa Komyushou Desu."},"altTitles":[{"ja-ro":"Comi-san ha Comyusho Desu."},{"en":"Komi Can't Communicate"},{"en":"Komi-san Can't Communicate."},{"en":"Komi-san Has a Communication Disorder."},{"ja-ro":"Komi-san wa, Communication Shougai desu."},{"en":"Miss Komi Is Bad at Communication."},{"ru":"\u0423 \u041a\u043e\u043c\u0438-\u0441\u0430\u043d \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u044b \u0441 \u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c"},{"th":"\u0e42\u0e09\u0e21\u0e07\u0e32\u0e21\u0e1e\u0e39\u0e14\u0e44\u0e21\u0e48\u0e40\u0e01\u0e48\u0e07\u0e01\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e1c\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e40\u0e1e\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e44\u0e21\u0e48\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e21\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e07"},{"ja":"\u53e4\u898b\u3055\u3093\u306f\u3001\u30b3\u30df\u30e5\u75c7\u3067\u3059\u3002"},{"ko":"\ucf54\ubbf8 \uc591\uc740, \ucee4\ubba4\uc99d\uc774\uc5d0\uc694"},{"ar":"\u0643\u0648\u0645\u064a \u0633\u0627\u0646 \u0644\u0627 \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0635\u0644"},{"ja-ro":"Furumi-san wa, Komyu-sh\u014ddesu."},{"vi":"Komi - N\u1eef th\u1ea7n s\u1ee3 giao ti\u1ebfp"},{"fr":"Komi cherche ses mots"},{"tr":"Komi Konu\u015fmaktan Korkuyor"},{"pt":"Komi n\u00e3o consegue se comunicar"},{"id":"Komi Sulit Berkomunikasi"},{"ms":"Komi Tidak Boleh Berkomunikasi"},{"hu":"Komi-san Kommunik\u00e1ci\u00f3s Zavarral K\u00fczd"},{"cs":"Komi-san nem\u016f\u017ee komunikovat"},{"pl":"Komi-san nie m\u00f3c komunikuje"},{"pl":"Komi-san nie m\u00f3c porozumiewa"},{"es":"Komi-san no puede comunicarse"},{"pt":"Senhora Komi n\u00e3o consegue se comunicar"},{"pt-br":"Senhorita Komi n\u00e3o consegue se comunicar"},{"ru":"\u041a\u043e\u043c\u0438-\u0441\u0430\u043d \u0432\u0430, \u043a\u043e\u043c\u044e\u0441\u0451: \u0434\u044d\u0441\u0443"},{"mn":"\u041a\u043e\u043c\u0438-\u0441\u0430\u043d \u0445\u0430\u0440\u0438\u043b\u0446\u0430\u0436 \u0447\u0430\u0434\u0434\u0430\u0433\u0433\u04af\u0439"},{"ru":"\u0423 \u041a\u043e\u043c\u0438-\u0441\u0430\u043d \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u044b \u0441 \u043e\u0431\u0449\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435\u043c"},{"uk":"\u0423 \u041a\u043e\u043c\u0456-\u0441\u0430\u043d \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0431\u043b\u0435\u043c\u0438 \u0437\u0456 \u0441\u043f\u0456\u043b\u043a\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f\u043c"},{"ar":"\u0643\u0648\u0645\u064a \u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0633\u062a\u0637\u064a\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0635\u0644"},{"fa":"\u06a9\u0648\u0645\u06cc \u0646\u0645\u06cc\u062a\u0648\u0627\u0646\u062f \u0635\u062d\u0628\u062a \u06a9\u0646\u062f"},{"ne":"\u0915\u094b\u092e\u0940 \u0938\u091e\u094d\u091a\u093e\u0930 \u0917\u0930\u094d\u0928 \u0938\u0915\u094d\u0926\u0948\u0928\u0964"},{"th":"\u0e42\u0e09\u0e21\u0e07\u0e32\u0e21\u0e1e\u0e39\u0e14\u0e44\u0e21\u0e48\u0e40\u0e01\u0e48\u0e07\u0e01\u0e31\u0e1a\u0e1c\u0e2d\u0e07\u0e40\u0e1e\u0e37\u0e48\u0e2d\u0e19\u0e44\u0e21\u0e48\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e21\u0e40\u0e15\u0e47\u0e07"},{"zh-hk":"\u53e4\u898b\u540c\u5b78\u662f\u6e9d\u901a\u9b6f\u86c7\u3002"},{"zh-hk":"\u53e4\u898b\u540c\u5b78\u6709\u4ea4\u6d41\u969c\u7919\u75c7"},{"zh":"\u53e4\u89c1\u540c\u5b66\u6709\u4ea4\u6d41\u969c\u788d\u75c7"},{"ko":"\ucf54\ubbf8 \uc591\uc740 \ucee4\ubba4\uc99d\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4"},{"ko":"\ucf54\ubbf8 \uc591\uc740, \ucee4\ubba4\uc99d\uc774\uc5d0\uc694"},{"vi":"Komi Kh\u00f4ng Th\u1ec3 Giao Ti\u1ebfp"}],"description":{"en":"Komi-san is a beautiful and admirable girl that no one can take their eyes off of. Almost the whole school sees her as the cold beauty that's out of their league, but Tadano Hitohito knows the truth: she's just really bad at communicating with others.\n\nKomi-san, who wishes to fix this bad habit of hers, tries to improve it with the help of Tadano-kun by achieving her goal of having 100 friends.\n\n---\n**Links:**\n- Alternative Official English - [VIZ Manga Chapters](https:\/\/www.viz.com\/vizmanga\/chapters\/komi-cant-communicate)","es":"Hitohito Tadano acaba de empezar la secundaria alta anhelando que sea pura paz y tranquilidad, pero sus planes se truncan cuando termina sentado al lado de la perfecta Shoko Komi. Ella es linda, inteligente, educada y hasta huele bien. Pero tiene 0 dotes sociales y no sabe c\u00f3mo corno comunicarse con los dem\u00e1s. Es ah\u00ed que Tadano se sube al pony y se propone ayudarla a su compa\u00f1era hasta que se haga de cien amigos, y con suerte algo m\u00e1s.","pl":"Komi-san jest pi\u0119kn\u0105 i godn\u0105 podziwu dziewczyn\u0105, od kt\u00f3rej nikt nie mo\u017ce oderwa\u0107 oczu. Prawie ca\u0142a szko\u0142a postrzega j\u0105 jako zimne pi\u0119kno, kt\u00f3re jest poza ich zasi\u0119giem, ale Tadano Hitohito zna prawd\u0119: m\u0142oda pi\u0119kno\u015b\u0107 po prostu \u017ale komunikuje si\u0119 z innymi. Komi-san, chce to zmieni\u0107, a ma jej w tym pom\u00f3c Tadano.","es-la":"El viaje a 100 amigos comienza con una sola conversaci\u00f3n. El mayor sue\u00f1o de la estudiante de secundaria socialmente ansiosa Shouko Komi es hacer amigos, \u00a1pero todos en la escuela confunden su ansiedad social paralizante con una reserva fr\u00eda! Con todo el cuerpo estudiantil manteniendo su distancia y Komi incapaz de pronunciar una sola palabra, la amistad podr\u00eda estar siempre fuera de su alcance. Tadano Hitohito es un chico ordinario total, y as\u00ed es como le gusta. Vive para mezclarse con el fondo. Todo eso cambia cuando se encuentra solo en un sal\u00f3n de clases el primer d\u00eda de la escuela secundaria con la legendaria Komi. R\u00e1pidamente se da cuenta de que ella no es distante, sino que tiene problemas para comunicarse con los dem\u00e1s. \u00a1Ahora ha hecho su misi\u00f3n ayudarla en su b\u00fasqueda para hacer 100 amigos!","pt-br":"Komi-san \u00e9 uma bela e admir\u00e1vel garota que ningu\u00e9m consegue tirar os olhos. Quase todos da escola a veem como algu\u00e9m fora do alcance, mas Tadano Shigeo sabe a verdade: **ela apenas n\u00e3o sabe como se comunicar com os outras pessoas**. Komi-san, que deseja corrigir este mau h\u00e1bito dela, tenta melhorar com a ajuda do Tadano-kun..."},"isLocked":true,"links":{"al":"97852","ap":"komi-cant-communicate","bw":"series\/129153","kt":"37855","mu":"z350eqh","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/gp\/product\/B07CBD8DKM","cdj":"http:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-1985640","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/382444\/","mal":"99007","raw":"https:\/\/websunday.net\/rensai\/komisan\/","engtl":"https:\/\/www.viz.com\/komi-can-t-communicate"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"37","lastChapter":"500","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":2016,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"0a39b5a1-b235-4886-a747-1d05d216532d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Award Winning"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2018-11-22T23:31:37+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T17:14:41+00:00","version":113,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["pt-br","id","vi","cs","es-la","ru","ar","fa","tr","en","fr","pl","mn","it","de","uk","ms","hi","tl","hu","nl"],"latestUploadedChapter":"6fd5bfb0-0770-4ae9-bfb7-c9455b991060"},"relationships":[{"id":"4218b1ee-cde4-44dc-84c7-d9a794a7e56d","type":"author"},{"id":"4218b1ee-cde4-44dc-84c7-d9a794a7e56d","type":"artist"},{"id":"0ef0faf8-eb94-458d-8f91-3b386fccb1ba","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"Source: BookLive","volume":"37","fileName":"f8f44329-1dd7-4301-9ec7-a4a76182e8eb.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2025-03-14T14:43:59+00:00","updatedAt":"2025-03-14T14:43:59+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"09806089-7a7d-41c3-a9e6-0f53b43d64ef","type":"manga","related":"preserialization"},{"id":"2917e1b1-06c0-45fe-b30b-6688d83859b2","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"2b214f77-deee-4144-810a-2ca771d5840f","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"3e8df40e-e2b3-4336-987b-f3e52d00ce5f","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"4bf151e7-5389-410f-a8a8-5df11d46a98a","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"60e5c222-f0aa-4f14-baba-b18207321d5e","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"82478f68-943e-4391-b445-f2f9b0007b95","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"973de049-748a-4446-98b9-dfea826f61a5","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"cb655d77-f369-4a06-9a35-b38c00f34e9b","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"d6448e6b-4409-4380-b74e-1629c6d1d1a7","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"dafa95c2-7c5e-47f8-be11-6d75bd7bee1e","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"fb569d12-1e00-47e3-86cd-793b4eae715c","type":"manga","related":"colored"}]},{"id":"58bc83a0-1808-484e-88b9-17e167469e23","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Lv2 kara Cheat datta Moto Yuusha Kouho no Mattari Isekai Life"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"Lv2\u304b\u3089\u30c1\u30fc\u30c8\u3060\u3063\u305f\u5143\u52c7\u8005\u5019\u88dc\u306e\u307e\u3063\u305f\u308a\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u30e9\u30a4\u30d5"},{"en":"Chillin' in Another World with Level 2 Super Cheat Powers"},{"en":"Chillin Different World Life of the EX-Brave Candidate was Cheat from Lv 2"},{"ko":"LV2\ubd80\ud130 \uce58\ud2b8\uc600\ub358 \uc804\uc9c1 \uc6a9\uc0ac\ud6c4\ubcf4\uc758 \uc720\uc720\uc790\uc801 \uc774\uc138\uacc4 \ub77c\uc774\ud504"},{"zh":"\u52c7\u8005\u5019\u8865\u7684\u60a0\u95f2\u7684\u5f02\u4e16\u754c\u751f\u6d3b"},{"pt-br":"O ex-candidato a her\u00f3i, que esteve em lv2, almeja ter uma vida pac\u00edfica em outro mundo"},{"ru":"\u041d\u0435\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u044c \u0432 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u043c \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0435 \u044d\u043a\u0441-\u043a\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0438\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u0432 \u0433\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0438, \u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0432\u0448\u0435\u0433\u043e\u0441\u044f \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043e\u043c \u0441\u043e 2 \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043d\u044f"},{"uk":"\u0421\u043f\u043e\u043a\u0456\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0436\u0438\u0442\u0442\u044f \u043a\u043e\u043b\u0438\u0448\u043d\u044c\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0432\u0438\u0441\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0446\u044f \u0432 \u0433\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0457, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u0440\u0438\u0439 \u0432\u0438\u044f\u0432\u0438\u0432\u0441\u044f \u0447\u0438\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043e\u043c \u0456\u0437 2 \u0440\u0456\u0432\u043d\u044f"},{"vi":"Cu\u1ed9c S\u1ed1ng Th\u1ea3nh Th\u01a1i T\u1ea1i D\u1ecb Gi\u1edbi Gian L\u1eadn C\u1ee7a C\u1ef1u \u1ee8ng Vi\u00ean D\u0169ng Gi\u1ea3 T\u1eeb C\u1ea5p \u0110\u1ed9 Hai"}],"description":{"en":"Banaza, who was summoned to the magic kingdom of Klyrode as a Hero candidate, was disqualified as a Hero because of his ordinary abilities. He was supposed to be returned to his original world, but due to the magical kingdom's mistake, he became unable to return to his original world. However, the moment he reached Level 2, he acquired every single possible skill and kind of magic, turning him into a super cheat with infinite skills! Despite this, he takes Fenrys of the demons as his wife, and fully enjoys his newly-married life with an easygoing smile. He changes his name to Flio and tries to lead his life quietly, but things are a bit chaotic with the likes of a pet saber, four freeloading female knights, a Majin, and even an ex-Demon Lord. However, even with all of this chaos, he still manages to enjoy his life peacefully.","fr":"Un jour, Banaza a \u00e9t\u00e9 invoqu\u00e9 dans un autre monde, le Royaume magique de Cryroad en tant que candidat H\u00e9ro\u00efque. Malheureusement, Banaza f\u00fbt disqualifi\u00e9 des candidats H\u00e9ro\u00efque car ces statistiques \u00e9taient tr\u00e8s basique. Alors, le Royaume d\u00e9cida de l'emmener loin du ch\u00e2teau car il \u00e9tait inutile. Mais alors qu'il se retrouva tout seul, un ennemi apparu devant lui, avec quelques difficult\u00e9s, il r\u00e9ussit \u00e0 vaincre l'ennemi, c'est alors qu'il monta de niveau, mais pas tout \u00e0 fait normalement\u2026","ja":"\u6804\u3048\u3042\u308b\u52c7\u8005\u5019\u88dc\u3068\u3057\u3066\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u306b\u53ec\u559a\u3055\u308c\u305f\u9752\u5e74\u30d0\u30ca\u30b6\u306f\u3001\u80fd\u529b\u5024\u306e\u4f4e\u3055\u304b\u3089\u52c7\u8005\u5931\u683c\u306e\u70d9\u5370\u3092\u62bc\u3055\u308c\u56fd\u5916\u8ffd\u653e\u51e6\u5206\u3068\u306a\u308b\u3002\u306a\u3093\u3068\u304b\u751f\u304d\u5ef6\u3073\u308b\u3079\u304f\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u5012\u3059\u3068\u3001\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u304c\uff12\u306b\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u5f7c\u306e\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30bf\u30b9\u304c\u898b\u6163\u308c\u306a\u3044\u300c\u221e\u300d\u306e\u8a18\u53f7\u306b\u5909\u308f\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u2026\u2026\u3002\u7a81\u7136\u306e\u30b9\u30c6\u30fc\u30bf\u30b9\u5909\u5316\u306b\u6238\u60d1\u3044\u306a\u304c\u3089\u3082\u30de\u30a4\u30da\u30fc\u30b9\u306b\u751f\u304d\u3066\u3044\u304f\u3053\u3068\u3092\u6c7a\u610f\u3059\u308b\u304c\u3001\u9b54\u65cf\u306e\u5a18\u30d5\u30a7\u30f3\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u3068\u904b\u547d\u7684\u306a\u51fa\u4f1a\u3044\u3092\u679c\u305f\u3057\u2015\u2015!?","ru":"\u0411\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0437\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u043b \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0437\u0432\u0430\u043d \u0432 \u0432\u043e\u043b\u0448\u0435\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0432\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e \u041a\u0440\u0430\u0439\u0440\u043e\u0443\u0434 \u0432 \u043a\u0430\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435 \u043a\u0430\u043d\u0434\u0438\u0434\u0430\u0442\u0430 \u0432 \u0433\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0438, \u043d\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u043d\u0451\u043c \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043a\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0442, \u0442\u0430\u043a \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0442\u043e\u0442 \u0438\u043c\u0435\u043b \u043d\u0430\u0432\u044b\u043a\u0438 \u043e\u0431\u044b\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0433\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0430\u043d\u0438\u043d\u0430. \u0418\u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0430\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e \u043e\u043d \u0445\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043b \u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0443\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u0438\u0440, \u043d\u043e \u0438\u0437-\u0437\u0430 \u043e\u0448\u0438\u0431\u043a\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u0435\u0439 \u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0432\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430 \u043d\u0435 \u0441\u043c\u043e\u0433 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0441\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0438 \u0431\u044b\u043b \u0432\u044b\u043d\u0443\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043d \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0436\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0432 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u043c \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0435. \u0421\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0432 \u0438\u043c\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0424\u0443\u0440\u0438\u043e, \u043e\u043d \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0438\u043b \u0436\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0432 \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0451 \u0443\u0434\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0438\u0435. \u0418 \u0432\u043e\u0442 \u0442\u0430\u043a, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0433\u0443\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044f\u0441\u044c \u043f\u043e \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0443, \u043e\u043d \u043f\u043e\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043b \u0441\u043b\u0438\u0437\u044c, \u043f\u043e\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0438\u043b \u0432\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u0443\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0435\u043d\u044c \u0438, \u0432\u0437\u0433\u043b\u044f\u043d\u0443\u0432 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u0445\u0430\u0440\u0430\u043a\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043a\u0438, \u0443\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u043b, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u043e\u043d\u0438 \u0438\u043c\u0435\u044e\u0442 \u0437\u043d\u0430\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u00ab\u221e\u00bb. \u0421 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0438 \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043d\u0435\u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0436\u0434\u0451\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u044c \u0432 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u043c \u043c\u0438\u0440\u0435.\n\n---\n\n(source: readmanga)","uk":"\u0411\u0430\u043d\u0430\u0437\u0443, \u0437\u0432\u0438\u0447\u0430\u0439\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0442\u043e\u0440\u0433\u043e\u0432\u0446\u044f, \u0432\u0438\u043a\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0430\u044e\u0442\u044c \u0434\u043e \u0456\u043d\u0448\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0441\u0432\u0456\u0442\u0443 \u0456 \u043d\u0430\u0440\u0456\u043a\u0430\u044e\u0442\u044c \u0413\u0435\u0440\u043e\u0454\u043c. \u041f\u0440\u043e\u0442\u0435 \u0443\u0432\u0430\u0433\u043e\u044e \u0432\u0456\u043d \u0431\u0443\u0432 \u043e\u0442\u043e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0437\u043e\u0432\u0441\u0456\u043c \u043d\u0435\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0433\u043e - \u044f\u043a \u0442\u0456\u043b\u044c\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u0438\u044f\u0432\u0438\u043b\u043e\u0441\u044c, \u0449\u043e \u0439\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0437\u0434\u0456\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0456 \u043d\u0435 \u0432\u0456\u0434\u0440\u0456\u0437\u043d\u044f\u044e\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u0432\u0456\u0434 \u0437\u0434\u0456\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0435\u0439 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441\u0456\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0457 \u043b\u044e\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0438, \u0431\u0456\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0430\u0445\u0443 \u0432\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0430\u0432\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0437\u0430 \u0434\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0456 \u0431\u0435\u0437 \u043c\u043e\u0436\u043b\u0438\u0432\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0456 \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u043d\u0443\u0442\u0438\u0441\u044c \u0434\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043c\u0443. \u0422\u0430\u043a \u0456 \u043f\u043e\u0447\u0430\u043b\u043e\u0441\u044c \u0439\u043e\u0433\u043e \u0441\u043f\u043e\u043a\u0456\u0439\u043d\u0435 \u0436\u0438\u0442\u0442\u044f \u0443 \u0437\u043e\u0432\u0441\u0456\u043c \u0447\u0443\u0436\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0441\u0432\u0456\u0442\u0456, \u0430\u043b\u0435 \u044f\u043a \u0442\u0456\u043b\u044c\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u0456\u043d \u0434\u043e\u0441\u044f\u0433\u043d\u0443\u0432 2 \u0440\u0456\u0432\u043d\u044f...","vi":"Banaza l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng nh\u00e2n lu\u00f4n ch\u0103m ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ed9t nhi\u00ean tri\u1ec7u h\u1ed3i t\u1edbi V\u01b0\u01a1ng Qu\u1ed1c Ma Ph\u00e1p Klyrode xa l\u1ea1 l\u00e0m \u1ee9ng vi\u00ean d\u0169ng s\u0129. Tuy nhi\u00ean, anh \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u00e1nh tr\u01b0\u1ee3t v\u00ec ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 1 gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 d\u00e2n th\u01b0\u1eddng. Kh\u00f4ng nh\u1eefng v\u1eady, anh c\u00f2n kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf v\u1ec1 v\u00ec sai l\u1ea7m c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh quy\u1ec1n... Banza \u0111\u00e3 r\u1eddi v\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u00f4 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1edbi v\u00f9ng bi\u00ean c\u1ea3nh v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3i chi\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ea5u v\u1edbi slime \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef m\u1ea1ng. Th\u1ebf r\u1ed3i, c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n c\u00f3 b\u01b0\u1edbc chuy\u1ec3n bi\u1ebfn l\u1edbn sau khi anh thay \u0111\u1ed5i h\u00ecnh d\u00e1ng v\u00e0 t\u00ean h\u1ecd. M\u1ed9t ma th\u00fa \u0111\u00e3 ph\u1ea3i l\u00f2ng anh \u0111i t\u1edbi h\u00f4n nh\u00e2n. Th\u1ebf l\u00e0 h\u1ecd c\u00f9ng nhau h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1edbi m\u1ed9t cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng th\u1ea3nh th\u01a1i, kh\u00f4ng ph\u00e2n bi\u1ec7t ch\u1ee7ng t\u1ed9c!","pt-br":"Banaza foi invocado ao reino m\u00e1gico de Cryroad como candidato a her\u00f3i. No entanto, por ter especifica\u00e7\u00f5es como as de uma pessoa comum, ele foi desqualificado e n\u00e3o p\u00f4de voltar ao seu mundo devido a um erro das pessoas que o invocaram. Sendo apenas n\u00edvel 2, Banaza obter\u00e1 for\u00e7as al\u00e9m de sua compreens\u00e3o.  \n\n\n---\n\n**Links:**  \n- [Author's Twitter](https:\/\/twitter.com\/kinojomiya)"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"107120","ap":"chillin-in-another-world-with-level-2-super-cheat-powers","bl":"630955","bw":"series\/211352\/list","kt":"54844","mu":"951v27f","nu":"the-laid-back-life-in-another-world-of-the-ex-hero-candidate-who-turned-out-to-be-a-cheat-from-level-2","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B084NNKR15","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/551865\/","mal":"119152","raw":"https:\/\/over-lap.co.jp\/Form\/Product\/ProductDetail.aspx?shop=0&pid=ZG0026&vid=&cat=CGS&swrd=","engtl":"https:\/\/sevenseasentertainment.com\/series\/chillin-in-another-world-with-level-2-super-cheat-powers-manga\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2019,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"39730448-9a5f-48a2-85b0-a70db87b1233","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Demons"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ace04997-f6bd-436e-b261-779182193d3d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Isekai"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"dd1f77c5-dea9-4e2b-97ae-224af09caf99","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monster Girls"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2019-10-09T22:38:28+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-04-22T21:46:33+00:00","version":75,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["es-la","uk","vi","en","pt-br","ru","fr","cs","id","tr"],"latestUploadedChapter":"031f222c-8680-4075-a880-14f3e3e6edeb"},"relationships":[{"id":"98a37e5d-1ffb-4a29-a4c2-87ff07e8a940","type":"author"},{"id":"468357b3-e0c0-45ab-b1b6-d07c3b7a1a9e","type":"artist"},{"id":"bacad8d5-d922-4277-84e8-e7f55fa15c82","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"15","fileName":"0d6b4727-2a84-43a7-85ec-0f7d307033e3.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-09-09T13:13:19+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-09T13:13:19+00:00","version":1}}]},{"id":"d86cf65b-5f6c-437d-a0af-19a31f94ec55","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Ijiranaide, Nagatoro-san"},"altTitles":[{"id":"Jangan goda aku, Nagatoro"},{"es-la":"No te burles de mi, Nagatoro"},{"fr":"Arr\u00eate de me chauffer, Nagatoro"},{"ru":"\u041d\u0435 \u0438\u0437\u0434\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0439\u0441\u044f, \u041d\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e"},{"ja":"\u30a4\u30b8\u3089\u306a\u3044\u3067\u3001\u9577\u701e\u3055\u3093"},{"ko":"\uad34\ub86d\ud788\uc9c0 \ub9d0\uc544\uc694, \ub098\uac00\ud1a0\ub85c \uc591"},{"de":"Neck mich nicht, Nagatoro-san"},{"zh-hk":"\u4e0d\u8981\u6b3a\u8ca0\u6211\uff0c\u9577\u701e\u540c\u5b78"},{"th":"\u0e22\u0e31\u0e22\u0e15\u0e31\u0e27\u0e41\u0e2a\u0e1a\u0e41\u0e2d\u0e1a\u0e19\u0e48\u0e32\u0e23\u0e31\u0e01 \u0e19\u0e32\u0e07\u0e32\u0e42\u0e17\u0e42\u0e23\u0e30"},{"ar":"\u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0644\u0639\u0628\u064a \u0645\u0639\u064a \u064a\u0627 \u0622\u0646\u0633\u0629 \u0646\u0627\u063a\u0627\u062a\u0648\u0631\u0648"},{"it":"Non tormentarmi, Nagatoro!"},{"fa":"\u0627\u0630\u06cc\u062a\u0645 \u0646\u06a9\u0646\u060c \u0646\u0627\u06af\u0627\u062a\u0648\u0631\u0648 \u0633\u0627\u0646"},{"he":"\u05d0\u05dc \u05ea\u05e9\u05ea\u05e2\u05e9\u05e2\u05d9 \u05d0\u05d9\u05ea\u05d9, \u05e0\u05d0\u05d2\u05d0\u05d8\u05d5\u05e8\u05d5"},{"es-la":"No me Molestes, Nagatoro-san"},{"en":"Don't Toy With Me, Miss Nagatoro!"},{"uk":"\u041d\u0435 \u0434\u0440\u0430\u0436\u043d\u0438 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435, \u041d\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e-\u0441\u0430\u043d"},{"cs":"Nehraj si se mnou Nagatoro"},{"en":"Please Don't Bully Me, Nagatoro"},{"es":"No me rayes, Nagatoro"},{"pt-br":"N\u00e3o Mexa Comigo, Nagatoro"},{"pl":"Nie drocz si\u0119 ze mn\u0105, Nagatoro!"},{"vi":"\u0110\u1eebng b\u1eaft n\u1ea1t anh n\u1eefa, Nagatoro!!!"},{"vi":"\u0110\u1eebng ch\u1ecdc anh n\u1eefa m\u00e0, Nagatoro-san"},{"tr":"U\u011fra\u015fma Benimle Nagatoro-san"}],"description":{"en":"Naoto Hachiouji \u2014our spineless\u2014 MC (Known also as \"Senpai\") is a second-year high school student and a loner who spends his afternoons at the Arts Club room. He attracts the attention of one of his schoolmates, a sadistic freshman girl named Nagatoro. However, in between the bullying and teasing, something else begins to blossom.\n\nA lovey-dovey(\u2026?) story between a shy nerd and an S-Dere (Sadistic Tsundere) begins.\n\n---\n\n**Links:**\n\n- Alternative Official English - [K Manga](https:\/\/kmanga.kodansha.com\/title\/10042\/episode\/313808) (U.S. Only)","es":"Naoto Hachioji est\u00e1 en segundo de bachillerato, es un chico tan t\u00edmido e introvertido como buen dibujante. Un d\u00eda, mientras busca un sitio donde sentarse a dibujar en la biblioteca, se le caen las p\u00e1ginas del manga que hac\u00eda, justo al lado de un grupo de chicas que, al verlas, se r\u00eden de \u00e9l en su cara y se van\u2026 excepto una estudiante de primero, Hayase Nagatoro, que b\u00e1sicamente empieza a darle ca\u00f1a hasta hacerlo llorar.\n\nDesde entonces, Nagatoro y consecuentemente sus amigas, no van a parar de rayar a su \u201csenpai\u201d y molestarlo de todas las maneras posibles\u2026 Pero hay tres cosas a tener en cuenta: Nagatoro es especialmente tocanarices cuando est\u00e1n a solas, se molesta bastante si sus amigas se pasan con \u00e9l, y en definitiva lo que ella busca es que su senpai salga de su burbuja autoimpuesta para que se divierta y conozca un poco el mundo que lo rodea\u2026 y quiz\u00e1s algo m\u00e1s\u2026","ja":"\u618e\u305f\u3089\u3057\u3044\u3051\u3069\u611b\u304a\u3057\u3044\u3002\u82e6\u3057\u3044\u306e\u306b\u508d\u306b\u3044\u305f\u3044\u3002\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u4e2d\u306e\u4f55\u304b\u304c\u76ee\u899a\u3081\u308b\u3001\u201cS\u30c7\u30ec\u5c11\u5973\u201d\u306e\u7269\u8a9e\u3002","pl":"Naoto Hachiouji to nie\u015bmia\u0142y ch\u0142opak, kt\u00f3rego ma\u0142o co przera\u017ca tak, jak wredne dziewczyny. Nic wi\u0119c dziwnego, \u017ce jego najwi\u0119kszym szkolnym koszmarem zostaje Nagatoro \u2013 kole\u017canka z ni\u017cszego roku, kt\u00f3ra obra\u0142a go sobie za cel, regularnie serwuj\u0105c mu atrakcje z pogranicza wojskowej fali i ko\u0144skich zalot\u00f3w. Cho\u0107 wydawa\u0107 by si\u0119 mog\u0142o, \u017ce szkolne \u017cycie ch\u0142opaka na zawsze pozostanie pasmem nieszcz\u0119\u015b\u0107, nieoczekiwanie relacja tych dwojga zaczyna zmierza\u0107 w niespodziewanym kierunku\u2026\n\n(\u017ar\u00f3d\u0142o: Studio JG)","ru":"\u041d\u0430\u0433\u0430\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e - \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0451\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0443\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0430 \u0432 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0440\u0448\u0435\u0439 \u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u0435, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0439 \u043d\u0440\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0434\u0440\u0430\u0437\u043d\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0441\u0435\u043c\u043f\u0430\u044f. \u041d\u043e \u043e\u043d \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u0441\u0442\u0435\u0440\u043f\u0438\u0442. \u0418 \u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0435\u043c\u0443 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0451\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0442\u0438 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u0434\u044b \u0438\u0437\u0434\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u0441\u0442\u0432 - \u043e\u043d \u0432\u0441\u0451 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0442, \u043f\u043e\u0442\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0432\u043b\u044e\u0431\u043b\u0451\u043d.","es-la":"A la estudiante de preparatoria Hayase Nagatoro le encanta pasar su tiempo libre haciendo una cosa, \u00a1y eso es molestar a su Senpai! Despu\u00e9s de que Nagatoro y sus amigos se topan con los dibujos del aspirante a artista, disfrutan molestando sin piedad al t\u00edmido Senpai. Nagatoro decide continuar con su cruel juego y lo visita a diario para poder obligar a Senpai a hacer lo que le interese en ese momento, especialmente si eso lo hace sentir inc\u00f3modo. Ligeramente interesado por Nagatoro y algo temeroso de ella, Senpai est\u00e1 constantemente involucrado en sus payasadas mientras sus intereses, pasatiempos, apariencia e incluso personalidad se usan en su contra mientras ella se entretiene a sus expensas. A medida que pasa el tiempo, Senpai se da cuenta de que no le desagrada la presencia de Nagatoro, y los dos desarrollan una amistad inc\u00f3moda mientras uno soporta pacientemente las payasadas del otro.","pt-br":"Nagatoro \u00e9 uma menina de primeiro ano na escola que adora fazer bullying com seu Senpai. Mas ele aceita isso, mesmo depois de ter passado por todos os tipos de situa\u00e7\u00f5es humilhantes e embara\u00e7osas, porque ele est\u00e1 apaixonado por ela."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"100664","ap":"dont-toy-with-me-miss-nagatoro","bl":"60008664","bw":"series\/155089","kt":"40324","mu":"0vvg24m","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/-\/en\/dp\/B07F7QD132","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-2958017","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/443422\/","mal":"110737","raw":"https:\/\/pocket.shonenmagazine.com\/episode\/13932016480029136187","engtl":"https:\/\/kodansha.us\/series\/dont-toy-with-me-miss-nagatoro\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"20","lastChapter":"154","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"completed","year":2017,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"69964a64-2f90-4d33-beeb-f3ed2875eb4c","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Sports"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"fad12b5e-68ba-460e-b933-9ae8318f5b65","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Gyaru"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2019-03-04T12:21:59+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-04-12T20:47:33+00:00","version":361,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["id","ru","es-la","pt-br","vi","fa","it","sr","en","cs","zh","tr","nl","uk","hu","es","pt"],"latestUploadedChapter":"6ff87c1f-a084-424e-994f-05bc77e3d095"},"relationships":[{"id":"7e552c08-f7cf-4e0e-9723-409d749dd77c","type":"author"},{"id":"7e552c08-f7cf-4e0e-9723-409d749dd77c","type":"artist"},{"id":"f8e2f663-31a5-4c4b-86e6-d1e0514dfe19","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"Format: Digital\nImprint: Magazine Pocket Comics \nPublisher: Kodansha\nYear: 2018","volume":"20.1","fileName":"5e4a4e0e-b2a6-4e7e-8e6e-169a8d26c7a8.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2024-07-30T12:41:50+00:00","updatedAt":"2024-09-23T16:25:24+00:00","version":2}},{"id":"1cf13b4c-fa1c-4832-a4ce-969d10c37a65","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"2a4bc9ec-2d70-428a-8b46-27f6218ed267","type":"manga","related":"side_story"},{"id":"546668d6-b91a-4c4f-8391-29f3e7e5bd86","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"9c4dbf10-10c3-496d-95d4-53b6bd8eccd7","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"b20ad1dc-23df-427d-bc64-00db3051cb19","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"b775fa6f-a72e-444c-b78b-a21c370490df","type":"manga","related":"preserialization"},{"id":"bd251d1a-0d27-454e-89c1-f2951fb03cee","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"df26bf01-110d-4b7c-9b7a-964ca39a784e","type":"manga","related":"colored"},{"id":"e7913068-ddf7-4aa4-9be6-35c204efb27a","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"}]},{"id":"7643e9f6-8455-4a58-b7e8-bf6cd00f5251","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Tsuki ga Michibiku Isekai Douchuu"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u6708\u304c\u5c0e\u304f\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u9053\u4e2d"},{"en":"Tsukimichi: Moonlit Fantasy"},{"ko":"\ub2ec\uc774 \uc774\ub044\ub294 \uc774\uc138\uacc4 \uc5ec\ud589\uae38"},{"ko-ro":"Dali Ikkeuneun Isegye Yeohaenggil"},{"zh":"\u6708\u5149\u4e0b\u7684\u5f02\u4e16\u754c\u4e4b\u65c5"},{"fr":"Un voyage dans un autre monde, \u00e9clair\u00e9 par la lune"},{"id":"Rembulan Menuntun Arah di Dunia Lain"},{"pt-br":"UMA JORNADA PARA OUTRO MUNDO LIDERADA PELA LUA"},{"ru":"\u041b\u0443\u043d\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0431\u043e\u0433, \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043a\u043b\u044e\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u0434\u0440\u0443\u0433\u043e\u0439 \u043c\u0438\u0440"},{"vi":"Nguy\u1ec7t \u0110\u1ea1o D\u1ecb Gi\u1edbi"}],"description":{"en":"High school student Misumi Makoto is called into a fantasy world by the god Tsukuyomi, in order to be a hero. However, powerful others in this world aren't as thrilled to have him there, and they kick him to the edge of the world just as Tsukuyomi declares that he must leave Makoto to find his own way. Now it's up to Makoto to find his own way!\n___\n[Official English Light Novel](https:\/\/hanashi.media\/tsukimichi-moonlit-fantasy\/)","fr":"Makoto Misumi, lyc\u00e9en japonais de 17 ans de petite taille et vice pr\u00e9sident du club de ky\u016bd\u014d de son \u00e9cole, se fait envoyer soudainement dans un autre monde par le dieu Tsukuyomi, qui lui apprend que ses parents sont originaires de celui-ci et qu'ils ont conclu un pacte avec la d\u00e9esse locale pour \u00eatre envoy\u00e9 au Japon.\n\nMais la dite d\u00e9esse le trouve trop laid pour \u00eatre un h\u00e9ros dans la guerre entre humains et d\u00e9mons qui d\u00e9chire son monde et le l\u00e2che litt\u00e9ralement dans les confins de celui-ci avec seulement la capacit\u00e9 de comprendre les langues des \u00eatres non-humains. Tsukuyomi intervient et lui donne une partie de sa force.\n\nMakoto rencontrera Ema une orc qui sera sa premi\u00e8re amie et fera de Shin, une dragonne qui se m\u00e9tamorphosera en jolie femme, son premier serviteur. Celle-ci voit avec le pouvoir de Makoto un de ses pouvoirs devenir un \"autre espace\" qui accueillera au fil des rencontres dans ce monde de magie et d'\u00e9p\u00e9e de nombreuses personnes.","ja":"\u4e3b\u4eba\u516c\u30fb\u6df1\u6f84\u771f\uff08\u307f\u3059\u307f\u30fb\u307e\u3053\u3068\uff09\u306f\u3054\u304f\u666e\u901a\u306e\u9ad8\u6821\u751f\u2026\u2026\u3060\u3063\u305f\u306f\u305a\u304c\u3001\u4e21\u89aa\u306e\u90fd\u5408\u3067\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u3078\u53ec\u559a\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3002\u3057\u304b\u3082\u305d\u306e\u4e16\u754c\u306e\u552f\u4e00\u795e\u3067\u3042\u308b\u5973\u795e\u306b\u300c\u9854\u304c\u4e0d\u7d30\u5de5\u300d\u3068\u7f75\u3089\u308c\u3001\u554f\u7b54\u7121\u7528\u3067\u6700\u679c\u3066\u306e\u8352\u91ce\u306b\u98db\u3070\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3057\u307e\u3046\u3002\u4eba\u306e\u6e29\u3082\u308a\u3092\u6c42\u3081\u3066\u8352\u91ce\u3092\u3055\u307e\u3088\u3046\u771f\u3060\u304c\u3001\u51fa\u4f1a\u3046\u306e\u306f\u306a\u305c\u304b\u4eba\u5916\u3070\u304b\u308a\u3002\u3088\u3046\u3084\u304f\u4ef2\u9593\u306b\u3057\u305f\u7f8e\u5973\u3075\u305f\u308a\u3082\u3001\u5143\u7adc\u306b\u5143\u5de8\u5927\u8718\u86db\u3068\u3044\u3046\u30af\u30bb\u8005\u305e\u308d\u3044\u3002\u3068\u3053\u3068\u3093\u4e0d\u904b\u3001\u3055\u308c\u3069\u30c1\u30fc\u30c8\u306a\u771f\u306e\u7570\u4e16\u754c\u73cd\u9053\u4e2d\u306e\u3086\u304f\u3048\u306f\u2015\u2015\uff01\uff1f","pt-br":"O estudante Misumi Makoto \u00e9 invocado para outro mundo, para ser o her\u00f3i. Mas a Deusa do outro mundo n\u00e3o gosta desse her\u00f3i, por isso o envia para o fim do mundo. Agora Makoto tem de encontrar o seu pr\u00f3prio caminho nesse novo mundo de fantasia!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"87225","ap":"tsukimichi-moonlit-fantasy","bl":"381852","bw":"series\/74772","kt":"36470","mu":"ixgbdrq","nu":"tsuki-ga-michibiku-isekai-douchuu","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B078MHKTJB","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-1922390","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/433004","mal":"90117","raw":"https:\/\/www.alphapolis.co.jp\/manga\/official\/48000051","engtl":"https:\/\/www.alpha-manga.com\/manga\/48000051"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2015,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"0bc90acb-ccc1-44ca-a34a-b9f3a73259d0","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reincarnation"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"39730448-9a5f-48a2-85b0-a70db87b1233","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Demons"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"aafb99c1-7f60-43fa-b75f-fc9502ce29c7","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Harem"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ace04997-f6bd-436e-b261-779182193d3d","type":"tag","attributes":{"na