-04T10:12:49+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-02-04T10:12:49+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"19e58e5a-4ecc-4f77-8b01-1ba7c615295d","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"93a571cd-9932-4960-bd68-35aef497a32e","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"},{"id":"f4cc68e3-2cbb-4af0-b362-49e4fae6aff5","type":"manga","related":"doujinshi"}]},{"id":"9d3d3403-1a87-4737-9803-bc3d99db1424","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Ki ni Natteru Hito ga Otoko ja Nakatta"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u6c17\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u308b\u4eba\u304c\u7537\u3058\u3083\u306a\u304b\u3063\u305f"},{"fr":"Le gar\u00e7on qui l'int\u00e9ressait n'en \u00e9tait en fait pas un"},{"ru":"\u041f\u0430\u0440\u0435\u043d\u044c, \u043a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u043c \u043e\u043d\u0430 \u0443\u0432\u043b\u0435\u0447\u0435\u043d\u0430, \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0430\u043c\u043e\u043c \u0434\u0435\u043b\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0435\u043d\u044c"},{"az":"Onun maraqland\u0131\u011f\u0131 o\u011flan \u0259slind\u0259 he\u00e7 o\u011flan deyilmi\u015f"},{"tr":"Ho\u015fland\u0131\u011f\u0131 \u00c7ocuk Me\u011fer Erkek De\u011filmi\u015f"},{"zh":"\u6211\u5728\u610f\u7684\u4eba\u4e0d\u662f\u5f02\u6027"},{"zh-hk":"\u6211\u5728\u610f\u7684\u4eba\u4e0d\u662f\u7570\u6027"},{"zh-ro":"W\u01d2 z\u00e0iy\u00ec de r\u00e9n b\u00f9sh\u00ec y\u00ecx\u00ecng"},{"id":"Pria Yang Dia Suka Ternyata Sama Sekali Bukan Pria"},{"fr":"She wasn't a guy (Mangetsu)"},{"th":"\u0e04\u0e19\u0e17\u0e35\u0e48\u0e40\u0e18\u0e2d\u0e1b\u0e34\u0e4a\u0e07\u0e04\u0e27\u0e32\u0e21\u0e08\u0e23\u0e34\u0e07\u0e44\u0e21\u0e48\u0e43\u0e0a\u0e48\u0e1c\u0e39\u0e49\u0e0a\u0e32\u0e22"},{"es-la":"El chico que le gustaba no era un chico"},{"vi":"Ng\u01b0\u1eddi M\u00e0 T\u00f4i \u0110\u1ec3 \u00dd \u0110\u1ebfn Kh\u00f4ng Ph\u1ea3i L\u00e0 \u0110\u00e0n \u00d4ng"},{"uk":"\u0425\u043b\u043e\u043f\u0435\u0446\u044c, \u044f\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u0457\u0439 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0431\u0430\u0432\u0441\u044f, \u2014 \u043d\u0435 \u0445\u043b\u043e\u043f\u0435\u0446\u044c"},{"ca":"El noi en qu\u00e8 estava interessada no era en cap cas un noi"},{"en":"The Guy She Was Interested in Wasn't a Guy at All"},{"es":"El Chico Que Me Gusta No Es Un Chico"},{"pt-br":"O cara de que estou a fim n\u00e3o era um cara?!"},{"en":"The Green Yuri"}],"description":{"az":"Bu twitter q\u0131sa hekay\u0259si m\u0259kt\u0259bd\u0259n k\u0259narda o\u011flan kimi s\u0259hv sald\u0131\u011f\u0131 orta m\u0259kt\u0259bli q\u0131zla onun sinif yolda\u015f\u0131 aras\u0131ndak\u0131 sevgi hekay\u0259sini t\u0259svir edir. N\u0259hay\u0259t,q\u0131zlar rok musiqisind\u0259ki ortaq z\u00f6vql\u0259ri \u00fcz\u0259rind\u0259 birl\u0259\u015firl\u0259r.","ca":"L'Aya, una estudiant que va a la moda, perd el cap pel treballador d'una botiga de discos.\nT\u00e9 un aire de misteri, un gran estil i un gust musical impecable.\nTot i aix\u00f2, ella no sap que aquest treballador \u00e9s de fet una companya de classe, la Mitsuki!","en":"Fashionable and upbeat high schooler Aya falls head over heels for an employee at a local CD shop. He\u2019s got an air of mystery about him, always dressed well, and has impeccable taste in music. Little does she know \u2014 this supposedly male employee is actually her female classmate Mitsuki!\n\nMitsuki generally keeps to herself, but since her seat is right next to Aya\u2019s, she can't help but be extremely aware of the other\u2019s crush. Revealing the truth is out of the question \u2014 but perhaps getting closer to Aya wouldn\u2019t be so bad...\n\n***Overwhelming winner in the Web category of the 2023 Tsugimanga Awards (by Kadokawa).***","es":"Aya, una estudiante de secundaria alegre y de moda, se enamora perdidamente de un empleado de una tienda de CD local.\nTiene un aire de misterio, un gran estilo y un gusto musical impecable.\nLo que ella no sabe es que...","fr":"Une histoire tr\u00e8s appr\u00e9ci\u00e9e sur Twitter sur fond de musique de Rock.\n\nAya, une populaire lyc\u00e9enne tombe sous le charme du discret vendeur du magasin de musique qu'elle fr\u00e9quente.\n\nRetour en classe, elle raconte toute l'histoire \u00e0 ses amies et comment elle a un faible pour ce gar\u00e7on aux airs de prince charmant.\n\nCe qu'elle ne sait pas c'est que ce myst\u00e9rieux vendeur n'est en fait que sa voisine de bureau, Mitsuki, qu'elle a confondu pour un jeune homme.\n\nComment leur relation va-t-elle \u00e9voluer ? Arriveront-elles \u00e0 expliquer ce quiproquo ?","id":"Series Pendek Twitter yang menggambarkan cerita tentang Gyaru dan Teman Sekelasnya.\r\nGyaru yang suka musik rock dan sering mendatangi toko kaset jatuh cinta ke pekerja paruh waktu yang bekerja disitu, tapi sedikit dia tahu ternyata pekerjanya itu perempuan dan teman sekelasnya.","tr":"Moday\u0131 seven ve enerjiyle dolu lise \u00f6\u011frencisi Aya, bir CD ma\u011fazas\u0131ndaki \u00e7al\u0131\u015fana s\u0131r\u0131ls\u0131klam \u00e2\u015f\u0131k oluyor. \u00c2\u015f\u0131k oldu\u011fu ki\u015finin etraf\u0131nda bir gizem havas\u0131 var, her zaman \u015f\u0131k k\u0131yafetler giyiyor ve m\u00fckemmel bir m\u00fczik zevki var. Ancak bilmedi\u011fi bir \u015fey var: Bu s\u00f6zde erkek \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan asl\u0131nda onun s\u0131n\u0131f\u0131ndaki k\u0131zlardan biri olan Mitsuki!\n\nMitsuki genelde kendi h\u00e2linde tak\u0131l\u0131yor ancak oturdu\u011fu s\u0131ra Aya'n\u0131n hemen yan\u0131nda oldu\u011fu i\u00e7in onun ho\u015fland\u0131\u011f\u0131 ki\u015fiyi s\u00fcrekli duymadan edemiyor. Ger\u00e7e\u011fi ortaya \u00e7\u0131karmak s\u00f6z konusu bile de\u011fil ama belki de Aya ile yak\u0131nla\u015fmak \u00e7ok da k\u00f6t\u00fc bir fikir olmayabilir...","uk":"\u041f\u043e\u043f\u0443\u043b\u044f\u0440\u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0440\u0456\u044f \u043a\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0442\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u043c\u0430\u043d\u0491 \u0443 \u0442\u0432\u0456\u0442\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0456, \u0432 \u044f\u043a\u0456\u0439 \u0440\u043e\u0437\u043f\u043e\u0432\u0456\u0434\u0430\u0454\u0442\u044c\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0440\u043e \u0456\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0456\u044e \u043a\u043e\u0445\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u043c\u0456\u0436 \u0491\u044f\u0440\u0443 \u0442\u0430 \u0457\u0457 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u043d\u0438\u0446\u0435\u044e, \u044f\u043a\u0443 \u0432\u043e\u043d\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u043c\u0438\u043b\u043a\u043e\u0432\u043e \u0441\u043f\u0440\u0438\u0439\u043c\u0430\u0454 \u044f\u043a \u0445\u043b\u043e\u043f\u0446\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0437\u0430 \u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u043e\u044e, \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437 \u0457\u0445\u043d\u044e \u0432\u0437\u0430\u0454\u043c\u043d\u0443 \u043b\u044e\u0431\u043e\u0432 \u0434\u043e \u0440\u043e\u043a-\u043c\u0443\u0437\u0438\u043a\u0438.","pt-br":"Uma Gyaru\/Gal que n\u00e3o se parece tanto com suas amigas (Gyarus tamb\u00e9m) frequenta uma loja de CD's e se apaixona pelo funcion\u00e1rio(?) de meio per\u00edodo do local.\r\nMas mal sabe ela que o funcion\u00e1rio(?) na realidade \u00e9 uma menina e \u00e9 uma das suas colegas de classe."},"isLocked":true,"links":{"al":"149544","ap":"the-guy-she-was-interested-in-wasnt-a-guy-at-all","bw":"series\/411030","kt":"63232","mu":"d86l207","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0C3HDP7DS","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/759188\/","mal":"155861","raw":"https:\/\/twitter.com\/agu_knzm\/status\/1512998788025110532","engtl":"https:\/\/yenpress.com\/series\/the-guy-she-was-interested-in-wasn-t-a-guy-at-all"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":null,"lastChapter":null,"publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2022,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"0a39b5a1-b235-4886-a747-1d05d216532d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Award Winning"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a3c67850-4684-404e-9b7f-c69850ee5da6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Girls' Love"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e197df38-d0e7-43b5-9b09-2842d0c326dd","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Web Comic"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f42fbf9e-188a-447b-9fdc-f19dc1e4d685","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Music"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"fad12b5e-68ba-460e-b933-9ae8318f5b65","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Gyaru"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2022-04-10T13:05:17+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-03-14T02:22:17+00:00","version":86,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["es-la","pt-br","uk","en","tr","id","pt","fr","es","ru","cs","ar","sr","ca","pl","la","mn","he"],"latestUploadedChapter":"0ee9a060-7484-42d7-8c37-f378b27deeed"},"relationships":[{"id":"12f9c76e-036f-4622-95aa-88aa54b3433a","type":"author"},{"id":"12f9c76e-036f-4622-95aa-88aa54b3433a","type":"artist"},{"id":"5f81a95a-cf5f-480b-82e1-93b390e66f94","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"Volume 4 Cover from BookLive","volume":"4","fileName":"fac191d0-96c1-4ebb-bf79-b7616d7162ac.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-03-14T02:22:27+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-03-14T02:22:27+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"6db15b12-bac4-4a80-87c1-713ff4447c6e","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"d7037b2a-874a-4360-8a7b-07f2899152fd","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Mairimashita! Iruma-kun"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u9b54\u5165\u308a\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01\u5165\u9593\u304f\u3093"},{"en":"Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun"},{"ko":"\ub9c8\uc5d0 \ub4e4\uc5b4\uac14\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc774\ub8e8\ub9c8 \uad70"},{"zh":"\u5165\u95f4\u540c\u5b66\u5165\u9b54\u4e86\uff01"},{"fr":"Iruma \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9cole des d\u00e9mons"},{"id":"Selamat datang di sekolah iblis! Iruma-kun"},{"ne":"\u0907\u0930\u0941\u092e\u093e\u0932\u093e\u0908 \u0921\u093f\u092e\u0928 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u0942\u0932\u092e\u093e \u0938\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0917\u0924 \u091b!"},{"pl":"Iruma w Szkole Demon\u00f3w"},{"ru":"\u041f\u0440\u0438\u0434\u0438 \u0436\u0435 \u0432 \u041c\u0438\u0440 \u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432, \u0418\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0430-\u043a\u0443\u043d!"},{"es":"Iruma-kun en el instituto demon\u00edaco"},{"th":"\u0e2d\u0e34\u0e23\u0e38\u0e21\u0e30\u0e04\u0e38\u0e07 \u0e1c\u0e08\u0e0d\u0e43\u0e19\u0e41\u0e14\u0e19\u0e1b\u0e34\u0e28\u0e32\u0e08!"},{"tr":"\u0130\u015fte \u015eeytan Geliyor! Iruma-kun"},{"tr":"\u015eeytan Okuluna Ho\u015f Geldin, Iruma-kun"},{"vi":"V\u00e0o Ma Gi\u1edbi R\u1ed3i \u0110\u1ea5y! Iruma-kun"},{"vi":"Iruma Gi\u00e1 \u0110\u00e1o"},{"zh-hk":"\u5165\u9593\u540c\u5b78\u5165\u9b54\u4e86\uff01"},{"ar":"\u0625\u064a\u0631\u0648\u0645\u0627-\u0643\u0646 \u0641\u064a \u0645\u062f\u0631\u0633\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0634\u064a\u0627\u0637\u064a\u0646"},{"fa":"\u0628\u0647 \u0645\u062f\u0631\u0633\u0647 \u0634\u06cc\u0627\u0637\u06cc\u0646 \u062e\u0648\u0634 \u0627\u0648\u0645\u062f\u06cc \u0627\u06cc\u0631\u0648\u0645\u0627!"}],"description":{"en":"Hopeless pushover Iruma Suzuki has found himself in a\u00a0devil\u00a0of a predicament... His trashy parents have sold off his soul, and he now has to live and attend school in the Netherworld. But with his unique survival skills and doting demon grandfather\u2019s support, Iruma will surely make it through this hellish experience. He'll just need to subjugate rival classmates, summon familiars, and more, all while never revealing that he's human... Easy as\u00a0*aleph, bet, gimel*,\u00a0right?","es":"Con una vida bastante desgraciada y unos padres vagos y avaros, Iruma es arrastrado al infierno contra su voluntad despu\u00e9s de que estos lo vendan a un demonio. Pero para su sorpresa, la vida que le depara el inframundo es mucho mejor que la que ten\u00eda con su familia.\n\nBajo la tutela de su nuevo due\u00f1o, un poderoso, pero solitario demonio que s\u00f3lo quer\u00eda cumplir su anhelo de tener un nieto, empieza a asistir a un instituto del que este es director despu\u00e9s de firmar cierto contrato con \u00e9l.\n\nAhora, Iruma tiene que intentar adaptarse al mundo de los demonios mientras esconde su naturaleza humana y se enfrenta a los distintos desaf\u00edos que lo esperan en su nuevo instituto. \u00a1Su nueva vida demon\u00edaca acaba de empezar!","ja":"\u4e21\u89aa\u306e\u79c1\u6b32\u3067\u60aa\u9b54\u306b\u58f2\u3089\u308c\u305f\u4e0d\u61ab\u306a\u5c11\u5e74\u30fb\u5165\u9593\u304f\u3093\u3002\u5b6b\u306e\u3044\u306a\u3044\u60aa\u9b54\u306b\u6eba\u611b\u3055\u308c\u3066\u60aa\u9b54\u306e\u5b66\u6821\u306b\u901a\u3046\u3053\u3068\u306b\u306a\u308a\uff01\uff1f","ru":"\u0427\u0435\u0442\u044b\u0440\u043d\u0430\u0434\u0446\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043b\u0435\u0442\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0421\u0443\u0434\u0437\u0443\u043a\u0438 \u0418\u0440\u0443\u043c\u0430 \u0442\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043a\u043e \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0431\u044b\u043b \u0431\u0440\u043e\u0448\u0435\u043d \u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0430\u043d \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d\u0443 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0431\u0435\u0437\u043e\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c\u0438 \u0440\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044f\u043c\u0438! \u0422\u0435\u043c \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435\u0435, \u043a \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0435\u043c\u0443 \u0443\u0434\u0438\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044e, \u043e\u043d \u043e\u043a\u0430\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0442\u0435\u043f\u0435\u0440\u044c \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0435\u0442 \u0441 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e\u043d\u043e\u043c, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0435\u0433\u043e \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0451\u043c\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u0432\u043d\u0443\u043a. \u0417\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043c \u043e\u043d \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u0438\u043b \u0432 \u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u0443, \u0433\u0434\u0435 \u0435\u0433\u043e \u0434\u0435\u0434 \u2014 \u0421\u0430\u043b\u043b\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043d, \u0440\u0430\u0431\u043e\u0442\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0432 \u043a\u0430\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435 \u0434\u0438\u0440\u0435\u043a\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0430. \u0422\u0430\u043a \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043d\u0435\u043e\u0431\u044b\u0447\u0430\u0439\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044c\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0436\u0438\u0437\u043d\u044c \u0418\u0440\u0443\u043c\u044b-\u043a\u0443\u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0442\u0443\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043d\u043d\u0438\u0445, \u0432\u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u0447\u0430\u044f \u043c\u043d\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0441\u043e\u0447\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u043b\u0438\u0446, \u043f\u0440\u0438\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u044f \u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0441\u043b\u043e\u0436\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438, \u0438 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u043b\u043a\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044f\u0441\u044c \u0441\u043e \u0441\u0432\u043e\u0438\u043c \u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043d\u043d\u044b\u043c \u2014 \u044f, \u043a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u043e\u043d \u043f\u043e\u0434\u043d\u0438\u043c\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f, \u0447\u0442\u043e\u0431\u044b \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044c \u043a\u0435\u043c-\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0435\u043b\u0438\u043a\u0438\u043c. \u0423\u044e\u0442\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432\u043e\u043b\u0448\u0435\u0431\u043d\u0430\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0432\u0441\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0435\u0432\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c \u0441 \u0441\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0439\u043d\u044b\u043c \u0433\u043e\u0440\u043e\u0434\u0441\u043a\u0438\u043c \u0442\u0435\u0440\u0440\u043e\u0440\u0438\u0437\u043c\u043e\u043c.","tr":"On d\u00f6rt ya\u015f\u0131ndaki Iruma Suzuki hi\u00e7bir iste\u011fe hay\u0131r diyemez. Sorumsuz ailesi, onlar\u0131 ge\u00e7inmek i\u00e7in onu tehlikeli i\u015flerden tehlikeli i\u015flere ko\u015fturtur ve sonra bir g\u00fcn onu bir iblise satarlar! Ancak iblis, Iruma'y\u0131 torunu olarak evlat edinmek isteyince \u00e7ok \u015fa\u015f\u0131r\u0131r. Bu iste\u011fi reddedemeyen Iruma, b\u00fcy\u00fck iblis Sullivan'\u0131n torunu olur. Yeni sevecen iblis dedesi onu, Sullivan'\u0131n tesad\u00fcfen m\u00fcd\u00fcr\u00fc oldu\u011fu \u0130blis Okulu Babyls'e kaydettirir. B\u00f6ylece Iruma-kun'un di\u011fer d\u00fcnyadakiler aras\u0131ndaki s\u0131ra d\u0131\u015f\u0131 okul hayat\u0131 ba\u015flar; bir\u00e7ok renkli iblisle tan\u0131\u015f\u0131r, zorlu m\u00fccadelelere at\u0131l\u0131r ve b\u00fcy\u00fck biri olmak i\u00e7in y\u00fckselirken ger\u00e7ek benli\u011fiyle y\u00fczle\u015fir.","vi":"Mairimashita! Iruma-kun l\u00e0 c\u00e2u chuy\u1ec7n k\u1ec3 v\u1ec1 c\u1eadu b\u00e9 Suzuki Iruma, ng\u01b0\u1eddi \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb b\u1ed1 m\u1eb9 m\u00ecnh k\u00ed kh\u1ebf \u01b0\u1edbc b\u00e1n cho \u00e1c ma \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ed5i l\u1ea5y ti\u1ec1n t\u00e0i v\u00e0 b\u00ecnh an. C\u1eadu b\u00e9 Iruma \u0111\u00e1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1eeb l\u00fac m\u1edbi bi\u1ebft \u0111i (1 tu\u1ed5i) \u0111\u00e3 ph\u1ea3i \"ra x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i\" l\u0103n l\u1ed9n, bu\u00f4n ba kh\u1eafp n\u01a1i v\u1edbi hai v\u1ecb ph\u1ee5 huynh \"t\u01b0ng t\u1eedng\" cho \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y m\u1ed9t \u00c1c Ma \u0111\u1ebfn r\u01b0\u1edbc c\u1eadu \u0111\u1ebfn Ma gi\u1edbi theo kh\u1ebf \u01b0\u1edbc. T\u01b0\u1edfng ch\u1eebng nh\u01b0 s\u1eafp v\u00e0o b\u1ee5ng qu\u1ef7 th\u00ec v\u1ecb \u00c1c Ma gi\u00e0 nua n\u00e0y \u0111\u00e3 kh\u00f3c l\u00f3c y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1eadu l\u00e0m ch\u00e1u trai \u00f4ng ta, v\u1edbi b\u1ea3n t\u00ednh l\u01b0\u01a1ng thi\u1ec7n v\u00e0 t\u1ed1t b\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u1ea3 b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n m\u00ecnh c\u0169ng ph\u1ea3i kinh ng\u1ea1c, c\u1eadu b\u1ea5t \u0111\u1eafc d\u0129 \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd l\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec1 ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0 nh\u1eadp h\u1ecdc tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u00c1c Ma theo \u00fd \u00f4ng ta. Chuy\u1ec7n g\u00ec s\u1ebd x\u1ea3y ra ti\u1ebfp theo, m\u1eddi c\u00e1c b\u1ea1n theo d\u00f5i cu\u1ed9c s\u1ed1ng h\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ea7y b\u1ea5t th\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ee7a Iruma-kun.","pt-br":"Iruma Suzuki, de quatorze anos, n\u00e3o pode dizer n\u00e3o a nenhum pedido. Seus pais irrespons\u00e1veis \u200b\u200bo fazem trabalhar em empregos perigosos para sustent\u00e1-los, e ent\u00e3o um dia eles o vendem para um dem\u00f4nio! Mas, para sua surpresa, o dem\u00f4nio quer adotar Iruma como seu neto?  \n\nIncapaz de recusar seu pedido, Iruma torna-se neto do grande dem\u00f4nio Sullivan. Seu novo av\u00f4 dem\u00f4nio amoroso o matricula na Demon School Babyls - onde Sullivan \u00e9 coincidentemente o diretor. Assim come\u00e7a a extraordin\u00e1ria vida escolar de Iruma-kun entre o outro mundo, encontrando muitos dem\u00f4nios coloridos, enfrentando desafios assustadores e enfrentando seu verdadeiro eu enquanto ele se torna algu\u00e9m grande.\n\n[ 1\u00b0 TEMP. DO ANIME ADAPTOU AT\u00c9: Vol. 7, Cap 44. ]\n[ 2\u00b0 TEMP. DO ANIME ADAPTOU AT\u00c9: Vol. 11, Cap 94. ]\n[ 3\u00b0 TEMP. DO ANIME ADAPTOU AT\u00c9: Vol. 17, metade do Cap 147.]"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"99324","ap":"welcome-to-demon-school-iruma-kun","bl":"445488","bw":"series\/115382\/list","kt":"39700","mu":"r4ayzg7","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B077LFF9V4","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/414185\/","mal":"104241","raw":"https:\/\/twitter.com\/wc_mairuma","engtl":"https:\/\/kodansha.us\/series\/welcome-to-demon-school-iruma-kun\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2017,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"39730448-9a5f-48a2-85b0-a70db87b1233","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Demons"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"9ab53f92-3eed-4e9b-903a-917c86035ee3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Crossdressing"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ace04997-f6bd-436e-b261-779182193d3d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Isekai"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2019-02-06T02:37:09+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-06-04T13:41:36+00:00","version":154,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["ru","es","id","pt-br","tr","vi","en","ar","fr","fa","tl","bn","es-la","ms","it","de","pl"],"latestUploadedChapter":"269dd7bf-6544-4e5f-95bb-b9d3bd5ac1d2"},"relationships":[{"id":"32a18c9c-4b1f-4485-a674-9657cf7d2b4d","type":"author"},{"id":"32a18c9c-4b1f-4485-a674-9657cf7d2b4d","type":"artist"},{"id":"02873075-ff35-4750-9fbb-cdd8bdbf56f2","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"50","fileName":"6917a533-d70c-49cb-84af-1aa7ccff3d02.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-09-04T16:51:19+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-04T16:51:19+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"4a904949-da95-4d7d-8b39-9af045ccc25e","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"61526d2c-1a12-402e-9072-76d4a8010cbd","type":"manga","related":"side_story"},{"id":"a2263632-9329-4e3d-95d5-ee9022128581","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"c8a49176-cf28-42e5-960e-8efd2d903323","type":"manga","related":"spin_off"},{"id":"ea47525d-99df-45b5-9103-dd853f49f8c3","type":"manga","related":"alternate_story"}]},{"id":"202718c6-525e-4cec-a469-c945548cacc3","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Anta to Osananajimi tte dake demo Iya nanoni! ~Zekkou kara Hajimaru S-kyuu Bishoujo to no Gakuen Nariagari Seikatsu~"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u30a2\u30f3\u30bf\u3068\u5e7c\u306a\u3058\u307f\u3063\u3066\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3082\u30a4\u30e4\u306a\u306e\u306b\uff01\uff5e\u7d76\u4ea4\u304b\u3089\u59cb\u307e\u308bS\u7d1a\u7f8e\u5c11\u5973\u3068\u306e\u5b66\u5712\u6210\u308a\u4e0a\u304c\u308a\u751f\u6d3b\uff5e"},{"en":"I Hate That We're Childhood Friends!: My Rise to the Top of School Life with an S-Rank Beauty Begins After a Falling-Out"},{"id":"Aku Benci Kita Berteman Sejak Kecil! \u2014 Kebangkitanku ke Puncak Kehidupan Sekolah dengan Si Cantik Berperingkat S Dimulai Setelah Perselisihan"},{"vi":"T\u00f4i Gh\u00e9t C\u00e1i Vi\u1ec7c Ph\u1ea3i L\u00e0m B\u1ea1n Thu\u1edf Nh\u1ecf V\u1edbi C\u1eadu! ~H\u00e0nh Tr\u00ecnh V\u01b0\u01a1n L\u00ean Trong H\u1ecdc \u0110\u01b0\u1eddng C\u00f9ng Nh\u1eefng M\u1ef9 N\u1eef H\u1ea1ng S Sau Khi Tuy\u1ec7t Giao~"}],"description":{"en":"Kazuma Suzuki was just your average high schooler\u2014until his childhood friend, Rua Takayashiki, a beautiful, sharp-tongued girl who also happened to be the granddaughter of the school chairman and the nation's top idol, cut all ties with him using a line straight out of a drama. Forced into submission for years as her so-called childhood friend, Kazuma decides it's finally time for his first-ever rebellion. He's done playing lapdog. This time, he's taking back his freedom\u2014and aiming for a normal school life. Escaping a powerful beauty like her is easier said than done...","fr":"Kazuma Suzuki \u00e9tait juste un lyc\u00e9en ordinaire, jusqu\u2019\u00e0 ce que son amie d\u2019enfance, Rua Takayashiki, une fille magnifique \u00e0 la langue bien pendue, qui se trouve aussi \u00eatre la petite-fille du pr\u00e9sident de l\u2019\u00e9cole et la plus grande idole du pays, coupe tout contact avec lui en lan\u00e7ant une r\u00e9plique digne d\u2019un drama.\n\nForc\u00e9 \u00e0 se soumettre pendant des ann\u00e9es sous le titre d\u2019\"ami d\u2019enfance\", Kazuma d\u00e9cide qu\u2019il est enfin temps de se rebeller pour la premi\u00e8re fois de sa vie. Il en a fini de jouer les toutous dociles. Cette fois, il reprend sa libert\u00e9 \u2014 et vise une vie scolaire normale.\n\nMais \u00e9chapper \u00e0 une beaut\u00e9 aussi puissante qu\u2019elle\u2026 est plus facile \u00e0 dire qu\u2019\u00e0 faire.","id":"Kazuma Suzuki hanyalah siswa SMA biasa\u2014sampai sahabat masa kecilnya, Rua Takayashiki, seorang gadis cantik berlidah tajam yang juga merupakan cucu dari kepala sekolah dan idola nasional, memutuskan semua hubungan dengannya menggunakan dialog yang diambil dari sebuah drama.\n\nDipaksa tunduk selama bertahun-tahun sebagai apa yang disebut sahabat masa kecilnya, Kazuma memutuskan bahwa inilah saatnya untuk pemberontakan pertamanya. Ia sudah selesai menjadi anjing piaraan. Kali ini, ia mengambil kembali kebebasannya\u2014dan mengincar kehidupan sekolah yang normal.\n\nMelarikan diri dari wanita cantik yang kuat seperti dia lebih mudah diucapkan daripada dilakukan...","ja":"\u65e5\u672c\u3067\u3082\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30af\u30e9\u30b9\u306e\u624d\u80fd\u304c\u96c6\u3046\u901a\u79f0\u201c\uff33\u7d1a\u5b66\u5712\u201d\u306b\u901a\u3046\u3001\u81ea\u79f0\u3069\u3053\u306b\u3067\u3082\u3044\u308b\u5c11\u5e74\u3001\u9234\u6728\u548c\u771f\u306f\u73fe\u5f79\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30a2\u30a4\u30c9\u30eb\u306b\u3057\u3066\u7406\u4e8b\u9577\u306e\u5b6b\u3068\u3044\u3046\u540d\u5b9f\u3068\u3082\u306b\u5b66\u5712\u306e\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u306b\u541b\u81e8\u3059\u308b\u5e7c\u306a\u3058\u307f\u306e\u9ad8\u6162\u6027\u60aa\u7f8e\u5c11\u5973\u3001\u9ad8\u5c4b\u6577\u7460\u4e9c\u304b\u3089\u300c\u30a2\u30f3\u30bf\u3068\u5e7c\u306a\u3058\u307f\u3063\u3066\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3082\u30a4\u30e4\u306a\u306e\u306bw\u300d\u3068\u30af\u30e9\u30b9\u30e1\u30a4\u30c8\u306e\u9762\u524d\u3067\u30d0\u30ab\u306b\u3055\u308c\u7b11\u3044\u3082\u306e\u306b\u3055\u308c\u308b\u3002\u300c\u3042\u3042\u3001\u4ffa\u3082\u3060\u3088\u300d\u3068\u7460\u4e9c\u3068\u306e\u7d76\u7e01\u3092\u5ba3\u8a00\u3057\u305f\u548c\u771f\u306f\u4eca\u307e\u3067\u7d76\u5bfe\u670d\u5f93\u3092\u5f37\u3044\u3089\u308c\u3066\u304d\u305f\u4eba\u751f\u304b\u3089\u8131\u5374\u3057\u3001\u666e\u901a\u306e\u5b66\u5712\u751f\u6d3b\u3092\u76ee\u6307\u3059\u3053\u3068\u306b\u3002\u3057\u304b\u3057\u548c\u771f\u306f\u5b9f\u306f\u666e\u901a\u3068\u306f\u7a0b\u9060\u3044\u898f\u683c\u5916\u306e\u30c1\u30fc\u30c8\u7d1a\u80fd\u529b\u306e\u6301\u3061\u4e3b\u3067\u672c\u4eba\u306e\u81ea\u899a\u3082\u306a\u3044\u307e\u307e\u5b66\u5712\u306e\uff33\u7d1a\u7f8e\u5c11\u5973\u305f\u3061\u304b\u3089\u30e2\u30c6\u307e\u304f\u308b\u3053\u3068\u306b\u2026\uff01\uff1f","vi":"Suzuki Kazuma, nh\u00e2n v\u1eadt ch\u00ednh b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng, \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb c\u00f4 l\u1eadp b\u1edfi Takayashiki Rua,m\u1ed9t c\u00f4 g\u00e1i xinh \u0111\u1eb9p nh\u01b0ng h\u00e3m l*n, ch\u00e1u c\u01b0ng c\u1ee7a hi\u1ec7u tr\u01b0\u1edfng tr\u01b0\u1eddng v\u00e0 c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n l\u1ef1c l\u1eabn danh ti\u1ebfng l\u1edbn nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t th\u1ea7n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea7u. Cho \u0111\u1ebfn b\u00e2y gi\u1edd, anh ta \u0111\u00e3 b\u1ecb bu\u1ed9c ph\u1ea3i \u1edf v\u1ecb tr\u00ed v\u00e2ng l\u1eddi tuy\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi t\u01b0 c\u00e1ch l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u1ea1n th\u1eddi th\u01a1 \u1ea5u c\u1ee7a Rua, nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean trong \u0111\u1eddi, anh ta quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh n\u1ed5i d\u1eady v\u00e0 nh\u1eafm \u0111\u1ebfn cu\u1ed9c \u0111\u1eddi b\u00ecnh y\u00ean cho b\u1ea3n th\u00e2n m\u00ecnh\u2026"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"152913","ap":"anta-to-osananajimitte-dake-demo-iya-nano-ni-zekkou-kara-hajimaru-s-kyuu-bishoujo-to-no-gakuen-nariagaru-seikatsu","bl":"20142467","bw":"series\/534673","kt":"74678","mu":"71d2als","nu":"the-self-proclaimed-normal-guy-of-the-s-class-academy","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0FJYTT3VX","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/917758","mal":"180314","raw":"https:\/\/magazine.jp.square-enix.com\/biggangan\/introduction\/antato\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"ongoing","year":2025,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"aafb99c1-7f60-43fa-b75f-fc9502ce29c7","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Harem"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"d